WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
The task drawer. Open any task in a side panel to edit every field without leaving the page.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: triage; sharing.

3
00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:12.050
Click a task to open the drawer.

4
00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:13.710
Edit any field — it saves as you go.

5
00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:18.630
Comments live on the task too.

6
00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:21.570
Escape closes the drawer.

7
00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:27.570
My typing was replaced as the drawer opened: Wait for the task to finish loading before typing; the drawer fills its fields when the task arrives. Fields are read-only: You're a Viewer in this workspace.

8
00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:32.070
Every field in one panel
